---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Custom Formulation Inquiry" description="Start with a feasibility review of your project brief" lang={lang} heroTitle="Custom Formulation Inquiry" heroSubtitle="Start with a feasibility review of your project brief">
  <section class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide">
    <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg text-gray-600 mb-10">Describe the application and constraints before choosing an ingredient or blend. We can review your inquiry to clarify requirements and possible next steps; this is not a commitment to manufacture or achieve a particular result.</p>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><article class="bg-off-white rounded-xl p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Application brief</h2><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Share the product format, intended market, ingredient restrictions and target sensory or functional properties. Avoid sending confidential formula details through the public form.</p></article>
<article class="bg-off-white rounded-xl p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Technical questions</h2><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Identify the variables that need evaluation: solubility, taste, color, stability, ingredient interactions and proposed test methods.</p></article>
<article class="bg-off-white rounded-xl p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Evidence and decision points</h2><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Discuss whether samples or trials are feasible, what evidence would support acceptance, and who will validate the finished product.</p></article></div>
    <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl"><p class="text-gray-600">Any proposed development, sampling or production work requires a separate written scope, feasibility confirmation and agreed acceptance criteria. Scale-up, stability, regulatory suitability and batch performance cannot be inferred from a website concept.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-block mt-6 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-primary text-white">Send a brief for feasibility review</a>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</PageLayout>
